ny image should be embedded as Base64.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"ToolOrbit image tools focus on the small but frequent tasks that happen before publishing: compressing large files, converting between PNG/JPEG/WebP, cropping to the right frame, exporting SVG artwork, generating favicons, and deciding whether a tiny image should be embedded as Base64."}],"$Ld"]}]]}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"]}]}]]
