d:["$","p","Most of these workflows run in the browser, which keeps draft visuals, screenshots, and design assets under user control while still giving teams a fast no-install workflow.",{"className":"border-l-2 border-blue-200 pl-4 leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:border-blue-900 dark:text-slate-300","children":"Most of these workflows run in the browser, which keeps draft visuals, screenshots, and design assets under user control while still giving teams a fast no-install workflow."}]
